<div class="container" style="max-width: 1100px;">
  <h2>About SeedQuest</h2>

  <p>
    SeedQuest is an independent agricultural analytics and breeding support platform
    focused on field experimentation, data quality, and practical agronomic decision-making.
  </p>

  <p>
    The platform is operated as a professional tool for real-world agricultural systems,
    supporting breeding programs, agronomic consulting, and applied research.
  </p>

  <hr style="margin: 25px 0;"/>

  <p style="font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.85;">
    <b>Credits:</b> SeedQuest builds upon scientific and technical foundations originally developed
    within the Sol Genomics Network (SGN) ecosystem and associated academic research initiatives,
    including contributions from the Boyce Thompson Institute and collaborating institutions.
    These contributions are acknowledged with respect and appreciation.
  </p>
</div>
